# The account's game phase, from host reads only (RV-011): the phase is what a player means by the
# opening, a settled account and a real empire. The reads and their thresholds are policy over host
# data: what marks each phase is named here, never in the class that reads it (Gate 1).
#
#   mid.planets:  the planet count that means the account has settled (a colony exists)
#   late:         the researched technology whose level means the account has outgrown the mines
